    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move The Core to your destination. What is your destination you may ask. <strong>FORWARD...</strong> Don't look back and don't ask questions, just remember one thing. You can be easily replaced, The Core can't so make sure to protect it even if it costs you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/1d688736e924e7da0d17550a96810004.poster.avif?t=1754392245\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/1d688736e924e7da0d17550a96810004.webm?t=1754392245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/1d688736e924e7da0d17550a96810004.mp4?t=1754392245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obviously it won't be that simple. Everything on your path will try to stop you. They don't want you to succeed. Maybe they're scared of what will happen if you do, or maybe they're just evil monsters who want this world to be in chaos forever. Doesn't really matter, just pull the trigger and move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/b225321c8c0c9c002af675d9895c3dc0.poster.avif?t=1754392245\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/b225321c8c0c9c002af675d9895c3dc0.webm?t=1754392245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/b225321c8c0c9c002af675d9895c3dc0.mp4?t=1754392245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what do you have in your arsenal to deal with those obstacles? Not much, a simple firearm and a fighting spirit, but don't worry, i'm sure you'll find something useful during your journey. Although i hope you understand that the chance of you coming out of this alive are very slim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/33945f86f78b117dfbac7c2dcb331a49.poster.avif?t=1754392245\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/33945f86f78b117dfbac7c2dcb331a49.webm?t=1754392245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436050/extras/33945f86f78b117dfbac7c2dcb331a49.mp4?t=1754392245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push Through Hell is a survival roguelike set in a post apocalyptic world, A world dark and cruel, where all you have to do is push the core to the very end and become a hero of this realm, Fight bosses, gain weapons and unlock upgrades that'll help you in your next attempts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple starting weapons and cores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadful Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tens of upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much MOREE!\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
